fication\",\n                \"text\": \"应在第24周访视评估主要终点；时间点应为第24周。\",\n                \"style_role\": \"body\",\n                \"provenance_lineage\": []\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        ],\n        \"notes\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"blk:v2_n_3_1_2_2:para_02\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"仅以“疗效”等标签或仅以统计方法名称描述研究变量，不应视为满足研究变量属性二；本章要求同时给出测量、聚合与时间点/窗口。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}","receipt":{"idempotency_key":"chapter-draft.generate.v1","input_artifacts":[{"ref":"chapter-intake","sha256":"34766de0a308b0d5808222f013340faa00cc4230b177a687370d567e684c5477"}],"logical_call_id":"call:chapter-draft:4c6d1ad12010c927c3e154b5e5b49ab68fb6e23d1c7ecdb0c39a5d99a1e2ca5e:chapter-generate","node_execution_contract_id":"nec:chapter-draft:4c6d1ad12010c927c3e154b5e5b49ab68fb6e23d1c7ecdb0c39a5d99a1e2ca5e:chapter-generate","observed_model":"deepseek-flash","observed_provider":"deepseek","output_schema_ref":"https://protocol-v3.local/schemas/ordered-chapter-draft-candidate.v1.json","output_sha256":"edd90cd9be45b673230491c95b78056758bb51eecacd3e8dc8215a5ded64668c","prompt_sha256":"9aec0ea7a8d8361fdb1c273790e20e30d5e6b1d7680ac1c6c63436bd71300fac","provider_session_id":"116d71b2-68bf-4921-9491-659efd6041cf","requested_reasoning_effort":"max"},"schema":"model_response.v1"}